 app/app.vue                         |  4 +-
 app/components/OrientationGuard.vue | 83 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 86 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 app/components/OrientationGuard.vue

diff --git a/app/app.vue b/app/app.vue
